   "comments": [
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "712020:6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Bilal Muzamil",
      "emailAddress": "bilal.muzamil@shopview.com",
      "self": "https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=712020%3A6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e",
      "timeZone": "Asia/Karachi"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "type": "strong"
           }
          ],
          "text": "Withdrawing this ticket - it was raised in error. ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "This was reported by us. It says the Business Hours switch shades nothing in Day view. That is not right, and the reason is our own mistake: the test case it came from starts with a precondition that says ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "type": "em"
           }
          ],
          "text": "\"The shop has working hours set\"",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": ", and when we looked at the screen the shop had no business hours set at all. The switch on the location screen was off, so there were no opening or closing times for the schedule to work from. With nothing set, there are no out-of-hours to shade, so shading nothing was the correct thing for it to do.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "type": "strong"
           }
          ],
          "text": "Re-checked today with the shop's hours actually set, and it works correctly.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "The shop hours were set to 06:00 to 18:00, Monday to Friday, and the same Day view was looked at again on build v3.5-7ec992f:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "content": [
           {
            "content": [
             {
              "text": "With Business Hours turned OFF, nothing is shaded at all.",
              "type": "text"
             }
            ],
            "type": "paragraph"
           }
          ],
          "type": "listItem"
         },
         {
          "content": [
           {
            "content": [
             {
              "text": "With it turned ON, two shaded bands appear - one covering midnight to 6 AM, and one covering 6 PM to midnight. The working day itself, 6 AM to 6 PM, is left clear.",
              "type": "text"
             }
            ],
            "type": "paragraph"
           }
          ],
          "type": "listItem"
         },
         {
          "content": [
           {
            "content": [
             {
              "text": "Turning it off again removes the shading. This was repeated and behaved the same way each time.",
              "type": "text"
             }
            ],
            "type": "paragraph"
           }
          ],
          "type": "listItem"
         }
        ],
        "type": "bulletList"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "The shaded band starts at exactly the 6 PM mark on the timeline, which is the shop's closing time, so it is shading the right hours and not simply shading something.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "type": "strong"
           }
          ],
          "text": "The test case behind this now passes, so nothing needs to be fixed. ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Closing this rather than deleting it, so the reasoning stays on the record for anyone who looks at it later.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
